{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>He will redeem my soul</b> — from those near me: they did not touch me." "<b>Were with me</b> — with a bet in the plural, like לחמו בלחמי (they fought alongside me). And the meaning: concerning the angels, for they are many who are with us."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 55, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:54.182607972Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}